C.3 Not compiled into the library:
    - sdk/minigl-29.1: the MiniGL 29.1 client SDK, which the demos and the
      card test link (sdk/minigl-29.1/licences); in the repository and in
      the release archive's Source drawer;
    - the openpci.library developer files (THOR-Software licence), which
      the hardware probes need: neither in the repository nor in the
      package. They may travel only as Thomas Richter's own archive (Aminet
      driver/other/openpci68k.lha); README.md says where they go.

GLQuake, the program RadeonGL is measured with, is not part of this
repository or of the package (GNU General Public License version 2; by
Frank Wille and Steffen Haeuser, after id Software's Quake).
